  "description": "Daily (unpublished) and per-order Tremendous balance check; DMs the admin below $500 or when an order is blocked. Stub balance from PF Config. DWN-6.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "bb5f0f7b-8fbb-4240-9ea3-37184ba10a51",
