        "content": "## PF Tremendous Balance\nDaily at 09:00 Madrid (**not published**, DWN-6 gate) or by hand: DM the admin when the balance is below the threshold ($500).\n\nCalled by PF Reward before every order with `{ source: order, amount, participant_name, host_name }`: returns `enough`, and DMs the admin only when the order is blocked.\n\nStub mode: the balance is `mockBalanceUsd` from PF Config. Sandbox and live are not built yet.",
